# C1 OOM-exp diagnostic intervention: slow the victim's MutationStage so admitted
# internode mutation messages accumulate in the per-connection receive queues
# (exclusive Q then endpoint/global reserve), exposing the exclusive-allowance
# multiplicity mechanism. Target is a Cassandra class (no boot: needed).
RULE c1 delay mutation apply
CLASS org.apache.cassandra.db.MutationVerbHandler
METHOD doVerb
AT ENTRY
IF TRUE
DO Thread.sleep(__DELAY_MS__)
ENDRULE
